      "side": 1,
      "message": "The formatting is correct but the length of some variables etc. made it a bit more clunky than necessary IMO - how do you feel about this version?\nI:\n1) Performed an early return if we do not use dynamic state, meaning we don\u0027t have to indent the logic here within an `if` which won some space back. Added a comment explaining the no-op case.\n2) Removed some of the argument comments (e.g. `/*compareMask\u003d*/`). While not bad to have, the general rule of thumb is we try to include that when we are passing in a statically defined generic/unclear \"magic number\" value. When using a variable name (or using a function with a clear name), it doesn\u0027t add much value.\n3) Defined some local variables with shorter names so things can be a bit more compacted.\n\nLMKWYT - all of these changes are merely suggestions and could be a matter of personal preference, so you\u0027re free to disregard them.\n\n\n```\nvoid VulkanGraphicsPipeline::updateDynamicState(const VulkanSharedContext* sharedContext,\n                                                VkCommandBuffer commandBuffer,\n                                                const VulkanGraphicsPipeline* previous) const {\n    // If dynamic state is not supported, this is simply a no-op and we can return early.\n    if (!sharedContext-\u003ecaps()-\u003euseBasicDynamicState()) {\n        return;\n    }\n\n    // Define some variables with shorter names for convenience.\n    const DepthStencilSettings\u0026 settings \u003d fDepthStencilSettings;\n    const DepthStencilSettings::Face\u0026 frontStencil \u003d fDepthStencilSettings.fFrontStencil;\n\n    const DepthStencilSettings* pastSettings \u003d previous ? \u0026previous-\u003efDepthStencilSettings \n                                                        : nullptr;\n    const DepthStencilSettings::Face* pastFrontStencil \u003d pastSettings ? \u0026pastSettings-\u003efFrontStencil \n                                                                      : nullptr;\n    const DepthStencilSettings::Face* pastBackStencil \u003d pastSettings ? \u0026pastSettings-\u003efBackStencil \n                                                                     : nullptr;\n\n    // The front-end currently is unaware of dynamic state, so we have no choice but to calculate\n    // the diff between pipelines and update the state as needed.  This is not quite so efficient,\n    // but will need awareness from the front-end to optimize.\n    if (!pastSettings || pastFrontStencil-\u003efReadMask !\u003d frontStencil.fReadMask) {\n        VULKAN_CALL(sharedContext-\u003einterface(),\n                    CmdSetStencilCompareMask(commandBuffer,\n                                             VK_STENCIL_FACE_FRONT_BIT,\n                                             frontStencil.fReadMask));\n    }                \n    if (!pastSettings || pastBackStencil-\u003efReadMask !\u003d settings.fBackStencil.fReadMask) {\n        VULKAN_CALL(sharedContext-\u003einterface(),\n                    CmdSetStencilCompareMask(commandBuffer,\n                                             VK_STENCIL_FACE_BACK_BIT,\n                                             settings.fBackStencil.fReadMask));\n    }\n    if (!pastSettings || pastFrontStencil-\u003efWriteMask !\u003d frontStencil.fWriteMask) {\n        VULKAN_CALL(sharedContext-\u003einterface(),\n                    CmdSetStencilWriteMask(commandBuffer,\n                                           VK_STENCIL_FACE_FRONT_BIT,\n                                           frontStencil.fWriteMask));\n    }\n    if (!pastSettings || pastBackStencil-\u003efWriteMask !\u003d settings.fBackStencil.fWriteMask) {\n        VULKAN_CALL(sharedContext-\u003einterface(),\n                    CmdSetStencilWriteMask(commandBuffer,\n                                           VK_STENCIL_FACE_BACK_BIT,\n                                           settings.fBackStencil.fWriteMask));\n    }\n    if (!pastSettings || pastSettings-\u003efStencilReferenceValue !\u003d settings.fStencilReferenceValue) {\n        VULKAN_CALL(sharedContext-\u003einterface(),\n                    CmdSetStencilReference(commandBuffer,\n                                           VK_STENCIL_FACE_FRONT_AND_BACK,\n                                           settings.fStencilReferenceValue));\n    }\n    if (!pastSettings || pastSettings-\u003efDepthCompareOp !\u003d settings.fDepthCompareOp) {\n        VULKAN_CALL(sharedContext-\u003einterface(),\n                    CmdSetDepthCompareOp(commandBuffer,\n                                         compare_op_to_vk_compare_op(settings.fDepthCompareOp)));\n    }\n    if (!pastSettings || pastSettings-\u003efDepthTestEnabled !\u003d settings.fDepthTestEnabled) {\n        VULKAN_CALL(sharedContext-\u003einterface(),\n                    CmdSetDepthTestEnable(commandBuffer, settings.fDepthTestEnabled));\n    }       \n    if (!pastSettings || pastSettings-\u003efDepthWriteEnabled !\u003d settings.fDepthWriteEnabled) {\n        VULKAN_CALL(sharedContext-\u003einterface(),\n                    CmdSetDepthWriteEnable(commandBuffer, settings.fDepthWriteEnabled));\n    }   \n    if (!pastSettings || pastSettings-\u003efStencilTestEnabled !\u003d settings.fStencilTestEnabled) {\n        VULKAN_CALL(sharedContext-\u003einterface(),\n                    CmdSetStencilTestEnable(commandBuffer, settings.fStencilTestEnabled));\n    }\n\n    // Check if front or back face stencil ops need updating\n    if (!pastFrontStencil ||\n        pastFrontStencil-\u003efDepthStencilPassOp !\u003d frontStencil.fDepthStencilPassOp ||\n        pastFrontStencil-\u003efStencilFailOp !\u003d frontStencil.fStencilFailOp ||\n        pastFrontStencil-\u003efDepthFailOp !\u003d frontStencil.fDepthFailOp ||\n        pastFrontStencil-\u003efCompareOp !\u003d frontStencil.fCompareOp) {\n        VULKAN_CALL(sharedContext-\u003einterface(),\n                    CmdSetStencilOp(\n                            commandBuffer,\n                            VK_STENCIL_FACE_FRONT_BIT,\n                            stencil_op_to_vk_stencil_op(frontStencil.fStencilFailOp),\n                            stencil_op_to_vk_stencil_op(frontStencil.fDepthStencilPassOp),\n                            stencil_op_to_vk_stencil_op(frontStencil.fDepthFailOp),\n                            compare_op_to_vk_compare_op(frontStencil.fCompareOp)));\n    }\n    if (!pastBackStencil ||\n        pastBackStencil-\u003efDepthStencilPassOp !\u003d settings.fBackStencil.fDepthStencilPassOp ||\n        pastBackStencil-\u003efStencilFailOp !\u003d settings.fBackStencil.fStencilFailOp ||\n        pastBackStencil-\u003efDepthFailOp !\u003d settings.fBackStencil.fDepthFailOp ||\n        pastBackStencil-\u003efCompareOp !\u003d settings.fBackStencil.fCompareOp) {\n        VULKAN_CALL(sharedContext-\u003einterface(),\n                    CmdSetStencilOp(\n                            commandBuffer,\n                            VK_STENCIL_FACE_BACK_BIT,\n                            stencil_op_to_vk_stencil_op(settings.fBackStencil.fStencilFailOp),\n                            stencil_op_to_vk_stencil_op(settings.fBackStencil.fDepthStencilPassOp),\n                            stencil_op_to_vk_stencil_op(settings.fBackStencil.fDepthFailOp),\n                            compare_op_to_vk_compare_op(settings.fBackStencil.fCompareOp)));\n    }\n    if (!pastSettings || previous-\u003efPrimitiveType !\u003d fPrimitiveType) {\n        VULKAN_CALL(sharedContext-\u003einterface(),\n                    CmdSetPrimitiveTopology(commandBuffer,\n                                            primitive_type_to_vk_topology(fPrimitiveType)));\n    }\n}\n```",
